{"id":"e0fc90210de59068","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-cook-levin.md","title":"thm-cook-levin (Cook-Levin Theorem)","display":"thm-cook-levin (Cook-Levin Theorem)","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","depends_on":["[[28-df-np]]","[[28-df-np-complete]]","[[28-df-poly-reduction]]","[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]","[[28-df-sat]]"],"display":"thm-cook-levin (Cook-Levin Theorem)","label":"28-thm-cook-levin","type":"theorem","aliases":["28-thm-cook-levin","Cook-Levin Theorem","SAT is NP-complete"],"eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0cb5248561455df8\" href=\"?note=0cb5248561455df8\" title=\"28-df-np\">28-df-np</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7a9125ebbfdef91e\" href=\"?note=7a9125ebbfdef91e\" title=\"28-df-np-complete\">28-df-np-complete</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"14088421136f8182\" href=\"?note=14088421136f8182\" title=\"28-df-poly-reduction\">28-df-poly-reduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4041cfa2975b8dd1\" href=\"?note=4041cfa2975b8dd1\" title=\"28-df-sat\">28-df-sat</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-cook-levin (Cook-Levin Theorem)"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-cook-levin"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-cook-levin</span><span>Cook-Levin Theorem</span><span>SAT is NP-complete</span></div>"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{NP}\">\\(\\mathbf{NP}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NPComplete}\">\\(\\mathrm{NPComplete}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}\">\\(\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SAT}\">\\(\\mathrm{SAT}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CNFSAT}\">\\(\\mathrm{CNFSAT}\\)</span> 分别见本目录对应定义；均使用标准有效二进制表示。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SAT}\\in\\mathrm{NPComplete}\\land\\mathrm{CNFSAT}\\in\\mathrm{NPComplete}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{SAT}\\in\\mathrm{NPComplete}\\land\\mathrm{CNFSAT}\\in\\mathrm{NPComplete}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall L\\in\\mathbf{NP}\\;\\exists f\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;\n\\left(x\\in L\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\in\\mathrm{CNFSAT}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall L\\in\\mathbf{NP}\\;\\exists f\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;\n\\left(x\\in L\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\in\\mathrm{CNFSAT}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>R6 证据边界：本次核对原书陈述、局部快照编码结构及末页构造；未逐项独立审计一般机器模拟、oblivious 化与编码大小界。因此本条保留为有来源的定理记录，不作为本次已完整核验的证明依赖。</p>\n<p>给定多项式时间验证器，把证据比特和计算快照作为布尔变量，初始输入、初始状态、局部转移一致性、最终接受各由多项式多个常元大小的检查表达为 CNF，赋值存在当且仅当验证器有接受证据。原书使用不动头位置可预先计算的 oblivious 机及快照，而非本目录旧稿未定义的四组 tableau 常元；两种构造同属局部计算编码。猜测赋值并求值给出 NP 成员资格。一般公式 SAT 与 CNFSAT 可多项式互约。</p>\n<p>来源核对：定理2.10(1)、引理2.11及证明；印刷45–49页；PDF71–75页。陈述和局部快照证明结构已核对；未作逐行机器验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-np","status":"resolved","id":"0cb5248561455df8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-np]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-np-complete","status":"resolved","id":"7a9125ebbfdef91e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-np-complete]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-poly-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"14088421136f8182","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-poly-reduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-sat","status":"resolved","id":"4041cfa2975b8dd1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-sat]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf{NP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NPComplete}","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SAT}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CNFSAT}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SAT}\\in\\mathrm{NPComplete}\\land\\mathrm{CNFSAT}\\in\\mathrm{NPComplete}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall L\\in\\mathbf{NP}\\;\\exists f\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;\n\\left(x\\in L\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\in\\mathrm{CNFSAT}\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1851,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-51","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"布尔问题：[[28-df-boolean-formula]]、[[28-df-boolean-evaluation]]、[[28-df-cnf]]、[[28-df-literal]]、[[28-df-clause]]、[[28-df-sat]]、[[28-df-3sat]]、[[28-thm-cook-levin]]、[[28-thm-3sat-np-complete]]。"},{"id":"8db0d5d40e579d59","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"048daeb639b8a67f","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"31a056a0868abd94","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"533a7b5c79de3204","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\#\\mathrm{SAT}$ 见 [[28-df-sharp-sat]]；$\\#\\mathbf P\\mathrm{Complete}_{\\mathrm{par}}$ 与 $\\le_{\\mathrm{par}}^{\\mathbf P}$ 见 [[28-df-counting-reduction]]；图灵完全性见 [[28-df-sharp-p-oracle]]。\n采用 [[28-thm-cook-levin]] 的确定型验证计算编码；所有证书长度固定为 [[28-df-sharp-p]] 的 $p(|x|)$，不同证书不按计算前缀重复计数。"}],"outgoing":["0cb5248561455df8","7a9125ebbfdef91e","14088421136f8182","adb92775ec020a0b","4041cfa2975b8dd1"]}